  "question": {
    "text": "The differential equation of the family of circles with fixed radius 5 units and centre on the line $y=2$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "NooLl",
      "text": "\n$(x-2) y^{\\prime 2}=25-(y-2)^2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "RHSEs",
      "text": "\n$(y-2) y^{\\prime 2}=25-(y-2)^2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "XYuV5",
      "text": "\n$(y-2)^2 y^{\\prime 2}=25-(y-2)^2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Rdldb",
      "text": "\n$(x-2)^2 y^{\\prime 2}=25-(y-2)^2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& (x-h)^2+(y-2)^2=25 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 2(x-h)+2(y-2) \\frac{d y}{d x}=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow(x-h)=-(y-2) \\frac{d y}{d x}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nsubstituting in (1), we have\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& (y-2)^2\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)^2+(y-2)^2=25 \\\\\n& (y-2)^2 y^{\\prime 2}=25-(y-2)^2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
